We’ve made a web series. It’s called Light Years and it’s a comedy. Every episode is a standalone story with the same four charachters. It’s like Seinfeld without lighting but with an Asian. We’ve only made three episodes. But if you guys like them, we’ll make more. If you don’t, we’re joining the manosphere. So please like it!Thank you to our amazing cast and crew. First episode drops Monday on our YouTube channel!<p><img src="https://prank-arum.github.io/Feeds/Instagram/2bd2bth/6728204454555816636260.jpg">]]>
